at night\u2014tired, distracted, or after a few drinks\u2014and suddenly everything changes. Would you be able to stay in control of the vehicle? At Four Players VR, we\u2019ve created a driving simulation in Virtual Reality that allows you to safely and powerfully experience how alcohol, fatigue, and distractions affect your reflexes, attention, and decision-making.\n\nGet ready to drive with awareness:\n\n\ud83d\ude97 Experience: Discover firsthand the effects of alcohol, drowsiness, and cell phone use on your reaction time.\n\n\ud83d\ude97 Live: Realistic scenarios that show you the risks of driving under dangerous conditions.\n\n\ud83d\ude97 Learn: Turn every immersive experience into a practical lesson to promote safer, more responsible driving.\n\nDon\u2019t leave your safety to chance. Join us and transform the way you drive with Four Players VR! \ud83d\udea6", "short_description": "\ud83d\ude97 Experience: Feel how alcohol, fatigue, and distractions affect your attention and reflexes behind the wheel.\n\n\ud83d\ude97 Live: Immersive Virtual Reality scenarios that realistically show you the risks of irresponsible driving.\n\n\ud83d\ude97 Learn: Turn the experience into awareness\u2014perfect for training, campaigns, and educational programs."}]}, "developer_name": "Soukai", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://soukai.com.ar/en/soukai-fpestudio-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://soukai.com.ar/en/soukai-fpestudio-terms-of-service", "publisher_name": "FourPlayers VR", "support_website_url": "https://fourplayersvr.com/", "website_url": "https://fourplayersvr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT",